<title>USA: Diamond Offshore Q1 EPS $0.79 vs $0.37.</title>
<headline>Diamond Offshore Q1 EPS $0.79 vs $0.37.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p>			  3  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.79		    $0.37</p>
<p> Net		 56,230		   18,732</p>
<p> Revs		204,733		  106,868</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted71,402		   50,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Avg shares in 1997 Q1 include 3,018,000 shares of common share equivalents from a convertible note issue of Feb 4.</p>
<p>The company said its increased revenues in Q1 1997 reflects revenues from the delivery of two rigs, one of which was drilling for the entire quarter. Both rigs are operating under three-year contracts, said Diamond.</p>
<p>Full name of company is Diamond Offshore Drilling Inc.</p>
</text>
